invariant: INV-16
file: session.h
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul
reason: tlsi_record_widemul writes the answer into the write direction alone,
  so every record a session opens runs Poly1305 under 0, the
  decomposition, whatever it answered. test/tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul.h
  counts each end's calls around its own calls and requires an end that
  answers CH_WIDEMUL_CONSTANT_TIME to call no file under its own names.

--- old
    t->rd.widemul = t->cfg.widemul;
--- new
